Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline addresses an opioid-pain-medication-use in a special-population.
Every opioid-pain-clinical-practice-guideline addresses an opioid-pain-medication-use in a special-risk-condition-population.
A special-population-example includes an older-adult-example and includes a pregnant-person-example.
A special-risk-condition-example includes a substance-use-disorder-history-example.
